  "term": "Thorazine",
  "definition": "Thorazine is chlorpromazine, a traditional antipsychotic in the phenothiazine group. It works mainly by blocking dopamine receptors in parts of the brain involved in psychosis, which can lessen symptoms such as hallucinations and delusions, and it also has anti-nausea effects.",
